OrderStatus enum with ACTIVE and CANCELLED. Change is necessary because ticket requires status tracking.\n\n2. **OrderController.kt** - Added `cancel()` method implementing POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel. Injected shipmentRepository to find and cancel shipments. Change is necessary to implement the cancel endpoint.\n\n3. **OrderControllerTest.kt** - Added 6 new tests covering:\n   - Order creation initializes status to ACTIVE\n   - Cancelling active order changes status to CANCELLED\n   - Cancelling active order cancels CREATED shipments\n   - Cancelling already-cancelled order is idempotent\n   - Cancelling order with CONFIRMED shipment returns 409 and changes nothing\n   - Cancelling non-existent order returns 404\n   - Tests also verify error codes and response shapes\n\n4. **ShipmentRepository.kt** - Added `findByOrderId()` method to find shipments by orderId. Necessary for cancel logic to check shipment statuses and cancel them.\n\n5. **ShipmentController.kt** - Added check in `create()` method to reject shipment creation if order is CANCELLED (409 with ORDER_CANCELLED error code). Injected orderRepository for this check. Necessary to implement ticket requirement.\n\n6. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 1 new test: `rejects_creating_a_shipment_for_a_cancelled_order_with_409` verifying shipment creation for cancelled order fails with 409 and ORDER_CANCELLED code.\n\n7. **ApiError.kt** - Added two new ErrorCode enum values: ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT. Necessary for consistent error reporting.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None.\n\nAll files changed are either in order feature, shipment feature, or shared api package as permitted by ticket constraints. No build files, deployment files, or unrelated code was modified.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint that allows customers to cancel ACTIVE orders, with idempotent behavior for already-cancelled orders, rejection if any shipment is CONFIRMED, rejection for non-existent orders, and prevents shipment creation for cancelled orders.\n\nChanged:\n- Order.kt — Added `status: OrderStatus` field (default ACTIVE) and OrderStatus enum with ACTIVE/CANCELLED values\n- OrderController.kt — Added cancel() method for POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint with shipment check and cancellation logic\n- ShipmentRepository.kt — Added findByOrderId() method to find shipments for an order (needed by cancel logic)\n- ShipmentController.kt — Added order status check in create() to reject shipment creation for CANCELLED orders\n- ApiError.kt — Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes\n- OrderControllerTest.kt — Added 6 tests covering all cancel scenarios (active cancel, idempotent cancel, CONFIRMED shipment rejection, non-existent order, created shipment cancellation, ACTIVE initialization)\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 1 test verifying shipment creation for cancelled order returns 409\n\nTests: \n- `created_order_has_ACTIVE_status` — Verifies new orders initialize with ACTIVE status\n- `cancels_an_active_order_and_returns_CANCELLED_status` — Cancel active order returns CANCELLED\n- `cancelling_active_order_cancels_its_CREATED_shipments` — CREATED shipments are cancelled when order is cancelled\n- `cancelling_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_and_is_idempotent` — Repeated cancel succeeds (idempotent)\n- `cancelling_order_with_CONFIRMED_shipment_returns_409_and_changes_nothing` — 409 if CONFIRMED shipment exists, no changes\n- `cancelling_non_existent_order_returns_404` — 404 for unknown order\n- `rejects_creating_a_shipment_for_a_cancelled_order_with_409` — Shipment creation for cancelled order returns 409\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory. Result: **BUILD SUCCESS** with all 20 tests passing (10 OrderControllerTest, 6 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests).\n\nNot done: Nothing. All acceptance criteria implemented, all tests passing, all edge cases covered."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":384,"cache_read_input_tokens":40838,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":384},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc451d05-8d0d-46bf-ba95-cacee775e9b1","uuid":"4d2d9c83-6399-4339-8c79-50cc0544317f","timestamp":"2026-09-26T19:31:57.291Z","request_id":"req_011CfScBZMFqPwyyCZgaeBFE"}
