ED orders\n- ApiError.kt — Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes\n- OrderControllerTest.kt — Added 6 tests covering all cancel scenarios (active cancel, idempotent cancel, CONFIRMED shipment rejection, non-existent order, created shipment cancellation, ACTIVE initialization)\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 1 test verifying shipment creation for cancelled order returns 409\n\nTests: \n- `created_order_has_ACTIVE_status` — Verifies new orders initialize with ACTIVE status\n- `cancels_an_active_order_and_returns_CANCELLED_status` — Cancel active order returns CANCELLED\n- `cancelling_active_order_cancels_its_CREATED_shipments` — CREATED shipments are cancelled when order is cancelled\n- `cancelling_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_and_is_idempotent` — Repeated cancel succeeds (idempotent)\n- `cancelling_order_with_CONFIRMED_shipment_returns_409_and_changes_nothing` — 409 if CONFIRMED shipment exists, no changes\n- `cancelling_non_existent_order_returns_404` — 404 for unknown order\n- `rejects_creating_a_shipment_for_a_cancelled_order_with_409` — Shipment creation for cancelled order returns 409\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory. Result: **BUILD SUCCESS** with all 20 tests passing (10 OrderControllerTest, 6 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests).\n\nNot done: Nothing. All acceptance criteria implemented, all tests passing, all edge cases covered.","ttft_ms":4740,"type":"result","duration_ms":191081,"uuid":"ba7f0316-717b-4c28-b895-a9104df8757d","ttft_stream_ms":714,"time_to_request_ms":27,"first_content_frame_ms":714,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

